<article class="env-lemma" id="03LR">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03LR">Lemma <span data-tag="03LR">66.18.12</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ X' \ar[r] \ar[d]_{f'} &  X \ar[d]^ f \\  Y' \ar[r]^ g &  Y }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a cartesian square of algebraic spaces over $S$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a sheaf on $X_{\acute{e}tale}$. If $g$ is étale, then </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$f'_{small, *}(\mathcal{F}|_{X'}) = (f_{small, *}\mathcal{F})|_{Y'}$ in $\mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (Y'_{\acute{e}tale})$<a class="footnotemark" href="#a0001343905" id="a0001343905-mark"><sup>1</sup></a>, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
if $\mathcal{F}$ is an abelian sheaf, then $R^ if'_{small, *}(\mathcal{F}|_{X'}) = (R^ if_{small, *}\mathcal{F})|_{Y'}$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Consider the following diagram of functors 
    <p>
      <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ X'_{spaces, {\acute{e}tale}} \ar[r]_ j &  X_{spaces, {\acute{e}tale}} \\  Y'_{spaces, {\acute{e}tale}} \ar[r]^ j \ar[u]^{V' \mapsto V' \times _{Y'} X'} &  Y_{spaces, {\acute{e}tale}} \ar[u]_{V \mapsto V \times _ Y X} }  \]
</div>
    <p>
       The horizontal arrows are localizations and the vertical arrows induce morphisms of sites. Hence the last statement of Sites, Lemma <a href="/tag/03CF" data-tag="03CF">7.28.1</a> gives (1). To see (2) apply (1) to an injective resolution of $\mathcal{F}$ and use that restriction is exact and preserves injectives (see Cohomology on Sites, Lemma <a href="/tag/03F3" data-tag="03F3">21.7.1</a>). 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>